  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 851488006144
    m_Localized: It's the Holy Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006145
    m_Localized: "How have you been? It\u2019s me, the Holy Warrior.\n\nThe dungeons
      are closed, and honestly, I can easily clap the monsters that wander down to
      the surface (for real). \nBut since the editing makes the content, nobody watches
      raw footage, and I want to keep my subs, so I sent an exclusive contract. \nJust
      keep working your magic like you used to.\n\nSo, here\u2019s the thing: I really
      want to marry the Princess. \nBut the King said he won\u2019t let me unless
      I defeat another Dark Lord. \nThat guy is more of a demon than the actual demons.
      \nAnyway, I hit up the Dark Lord and scouted a substitute. Everyone is super
      hyped, seriously. \nI barely stopped them from mass-inviting every monster
      in the neighborhood;; \nI told them just the Blue Dragon for now, but I\u2019m
      thinking of calling the other friends in next week.\nI already made a group
      chat, so please just handle the editing well.\n\nAttachment [ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006146
    m_Localized: So Fluffy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006147
    m_Localized: "Have you ever touched White Dragon fur? \nI have. It\u2019s so
      fluffy lol. \nI told him it made me sleepy, and I even snagged a cloak out
      of it. \nApparently, it grants fire immunity? If he gave it earlier, I could've
      shot cooler scenes in the dungeon. Useless now. \nBut at least I look sick
      wearing it. \nI already announced on the channel that the video goes up in
      three days, so please stick to the deadline. Definitely within 4 days, okay?\n\nAttachment
      [ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006148
    m_Localized: Toxic, Seriously
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006149
    m_Localized: "Toxic, seriously. You still won\u2019t let me marry her after all
      this? \nDid you see him snatch my White Dragon cloak just because it looked
      cool? 'Gift' my ass. \nThe Princess said she loves fried food, but I hate oil
      splashes. I was planning to wear that while cooking! What do I do now? Ah,
      I\u2019m seriously screwed. \nPlease handle this edit well too, and if you
      know any good defense wizards, please introduce me.\n\nAttachment [ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006150
    m_Localized: '[Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver] 50% Special Offer! Celebrating the
      Defeat of the Dark Lord'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 851488006151
    m_Localized: "This email is exclusively sent to members who have agreed to receive
      advertisement notifications.\n\nPromotion Target: Members of Manasoft Worlds
      Movie Weaver Free (Personal Use) \nPromotion Period: 1 month starting today
      \nPromotion Details: Gain access to the paid feature \u201CSFX\u201D for free
      during the promotion period!\n\nThe following functions are included in the
      promotion:\n\nNeed speed? Perfect for swift mobility. <b>Haste!</b>\nFast.
      Powerful. Spectacular. <b>Damage Boost!</b>\nThe one and only devastating smite.
      <b>Crit Hit!</b>\nThe new meta, back by popular demand! <b>Stun!</b>\n(NEW!)
      I ask you, art thou the Holy Warrior who slew the Dark Lord... <b>Berserk!</b>
      \n(NEW!) The strength to rise and fight again!  <b>Heal!</b>\n\n50% discount
      on Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver (VAT included. Annual or monthly billing) \nFind
      additional information about this promotion <u>here.</u>\n\n<u>Click here to
      claim your offer!</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
